    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get Involved!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Shadow Eclipse</strong> is a rougelite dungeon crawler focused on magic, darkness, unique builds, difficulty, and replayability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>Challenging</i>: Battle your way through increasingly difficult levels and see how far you can push your mage and develop a unique spell build! Bosses guard entryway to further levels.<br></li><li> <i>Multiplayer</i>: Play by yourself or host and share a lobby code with friends. Rooms in each level are laid out in a grid and grow wider depending on the number of players. The more rooms you can explore, the more spell upgrades you will find!<br></li><li> <i>Build Diversity</i>: Each room you clear drops randomized spell upgrades resulting in different mage builds every playthrough. Your mage can only know 3 spells at a time, forcing you to identify spell combinations, and make decisions about which spells to hold onto and which to forget.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/3363495eca7916d5c7e61de1739aa166.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Shadow Eclipse</strong> is a rougelite dungeon crawler focused on magic, darkness, unique builds, difficulty, and replayability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/568c42991b2e28cec8f55083eaa3bab6.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>Challenging</i>: Battle your way through increasingly difficult levels and see how far you can push your mage and develop a unique spell build! Bosses guard entryway to further levels.<br></li><li> <i>Multiplayer</i>: Play by yourself or host and share a lobby code with friends. Rooms in each level are laid out in a grid and grow wider depending on the number of players. The more rooms you can explore, the more spell upgrades you will find!<br></li><li> <i>Build Diversity</i>: Each room you clear drops randomized spell upgrades resulting in different mage builds every playthrough. Your mage can only know 3 spells at a time, forcing you to identify spell combinations, and make decisions about which spells to hold onto and which to forget.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.poster.avif?t=1718762860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.webm?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425670/extras/b9e6af40ebc67fed6d88f9d52e61b45b.mp4?t=1718762860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
